# The single-file amalgamation regenerates into build/amalgamate/ (covered by
# the build*/* rules above); it is not produced under dist/ anymore.

# Translated editions of the website are generated from web/index.html plus
# web/i18n/<lang>.json by gen_i18n.py, which publish_web.sh runs before every
# upload. Committing them would just create a second thing to keep in sync --
# unlike the WASM artifact, they need no toolchain to rebuild.
